 intro p F; have hp:0<p:=clockP ..; refine ⟨⟨?_⟩,⟨fun j=>?_⟩,?_⟩; · change 60*p≤80*p-0; linarith only [hp]
 · change 60*p≤ |0-80*p| ∧ |0-80*p| ≤ 100*p; rw [zero_sub,abs_neg,abs_of_pos (mul_pos (by norm_num) hp)]; constructor<;> linarith only [hp]
 ext1 i; change p⁻¹*(0-80*p)=-80; field
